+/// O(1) immutable view of one lossless, contiguous capture prefix. Acquiring a
+/// view retains only the newest chunk. Range materialization walks and copies
+/// on the caller, which must be an off-real-time worker.
+struct RecordingPCMRangeSnapshot: Sendable {
